---
title: Daiquiri
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, rum]
source: Our own
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @light rum{2%fl_oz} and @lime juice{0.75%fl_oz}(about half a lime worth). Add @superfine sugar{1%tsp}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @lime{1%wedge}.

> gold rum can also be used, but dark rum is often too heavy.
